    "en": {
      "trackName": "Bubble Shooter Watch Game",
      "description": "Bubble Shooter Watch Game brings the timeless and most addictive bubble-popping game to your fingertips with a modern design! Fully optimized for   and  Watch, you can now play wherever you go—directly on your watch using simple touch controls or the Digital Crown!\n GAME FEATURES:\n• 80 Unique Levels: From simple warm-ups to brain-teasing puzzles.\n•   Watch Support: Play seamlessly on watch  with a fully optimized interface and controls.\n• Easy & Intuitive Controls: Drag to aim, release to shoot, or tap directly on your watch screen.\n• Swap Bubbles: Tactical bubble switching allows you to plan your next moves.\n• Play Offline: Play anytime, anywhere—on the subway, on a plane, or during your break.\n• Satisfying Sounds & Effects: Dive into the game with crisp pop sounds and smooth animations.\n\nHow to Play:\n1. Aim your shooter in the direction you want to launch the bubble.\n2. Match 3 or more bubbles of the same color to pop them.\n3. Clear all bubbles on the board to complete the level.\n4. Tap the swap button to switch your current bubble with the next one.",
